          "pack-intake-triage",
          "pack-support-copilot"
        ],
        "started_from": "pack-document-review",
        "why": "The app's spine is ingest -> extract -> human review queue -> decision trail over borrower documents, which is exactly pack-document-review. It is a hybrid though: the intake-triage half (queues, SLA, explicit stage machine) and the support-copilot half (grounded citations, approval gate, transcripts) are both required, so the two other packs were merged in rather than adopted whole.",
