        "removed_from_pack": [],
        "notable_exclusions": [
          "ocr-bridge — GAP-056 settled that borrower documents arrive as native-text PDFs with extractable text; OCR is explicitly out of scope, so doc-extract + table-extract are sufficient.",
          "email-ingest — the pack-intake-triage intake path is a form (REQ-028), not a mailbox; no requirement asks for forwarded email.",
          "slack-notify / email-send / notifications-ui — no requirement asks for outbound notification; the SLA surface is a dashboard (REQ-022), not a push channel.",
          "scheduling / batch-runner — SLA idle time is computed on read from a business-day calendar (REQ-044); nothing requires background jobs, and Cloud Run request handling is stateless (REQ-026).",
          "soft-delete / data-retention — REQ-018 makes the audit trail append-only and undeletable; there is no retention/purge requirement to honor.",
          "permissions-ui / admin-console — REQ-041 fixes identities to built-in role-assigned accounts, so there is no role-administration surface to build.",
          "pdf-render — REQ-047 asks that the audit trail be exportable for examiner review; export-csv satisfies that without a document generator.",
          "sso-oidc — REQ-041 explicitly assumes no external SSO/IdP in v1.",
          "guardrails-io / data-classification — REQ-049's sensitivity handling is met by pii-redaction under transcript-store plus rbac-scoped access; no requirement asks for topic fences or column-level classification."
        ]
